<title>GERMANY: Bundesbank details M3 developments in August.</title>
<headline>Bundesbank details M3 developments in August.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank published</p>
<p>the following data relating to M3 money supply in August.</p>
<p>AGGREGATE (in bln marks)	    Aug96   Jul96  Aug95  End Aug</p>
<p>									    Level</p>
<p>1) BANK LENDING TO DOMESTIC</p>
<p>   NON-BANKS (total)		  +16.4   +11.9  +19.9  4,616.6</p>
<p>   Lending by Bundesbank	   +/-0.0 +/- 0.0 +/-0.0	8.7</p>
<p>   Lending by banks		   +16.4   +11.9  +19.9  4,607.9</p>
<p>    To firms and individuals	+17.1   +11.4  +15.9  3,489.1</p>
<p>of which</p>
<p>     short term lending	     + 2.6   -13.5  - 3.9    585.3</p>
<p>    To public authorities	   - 0.7   + 0.5  + 4.0  1,118.8</p>
<p>2) NET EXTERNAL ASSETS</p>
<p>OF CREDIT INSTITUTIONS</p>
<p>   AND THE BUNDESBANK		 + 4.4   + 1.0  + 6.3    284.1</p>
<p>3) MONETARY CAPITAL FORMATION</p>
<p>   FROM DOMESTIC SOURCES, TOTAL   + 7.2   + 5.8  +17.6  2,684.5</p>
<p>of which</p>
<p>Time deposits</p>
<p>     4 yrs and more		   + 5.7   + 7.4  + 7.0    778.9</p>
<p>Savings deposits over 3 mths</p>
<p>     notice, savings certificates - 1.5   - 2.1  + 0.7    499.0</p>
<p>Bank debt securities</p>
<p>     in circulation		   + 2.3   - 0.8  + 9.0  1,078.3</p>
<p>4) DEPOSITS OF FED. GOVT.</p>
<p>   IN BANKING SYSTEM		  - 0.2   - 0.0  - 0.2	0.0</p>
<p>5) OTHER FACTORS			+ 4.1   + 7.6  - 3.8    186.5</p>
<p>6) MONEY STOCK M3		     + 9.7   - 0.5  +12.6  2,029.7</p>
<p>    Currency in circulation	 + 0.8   + 0.7  + 1.1    240.0</p>
<p>    Sight deposits		    + 1.4   - 3.2  - 2.2    555.8</p>
<p>    Time deposits up to 4 yrs     + 2.3   - 1.6  + 7.7    416.5</p>
<p>Savings deposits at</p>
<p>     three months notice	    + 5.1   + 3.6  + 6.0    817.4</p>
<p>SEASONALLY ADJUSTED DATA</p>
<p>Money M3, monthly average</p>
<p>  annual change from Q4 1995 (%)  + 8.7    + 8.6   n/a  2,030.6</p>
<p>Annual change over past</p>
<p>six months (%)</p>
<p>   M3 aggregate			 + 6.8    + 8.6   n/a	n/a</p>
<p>   M2 aggregate			 + 0.6    + 2.1   n/a  1,227.5</p>
<p>   M1 aggregate			 + 8.0    +10.7   n/a    813.5</p>
<p>   M3 extended			    n/a    + 6.7   n/a	n/a</p>
<p>Lending to firms</p>
<p>    and individuals		   + 7.1    + 7.2   n/a  3,502.8</p>
<p>   Monetary capital formation     + 4.7    + 5.0   n/a  2,683.8</p>
<p>--Melanie Massier, Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
